   "source": [
    "# PHASE 3: Comparative Evaluation\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objective**: Benchmark DCTroy (proposed method) against baseline perturbation methods\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook compares:\n",
    "- **DCTroy**: Frequency-weighted DCT perturbations (mid-pass)\n",
    "- **Photoguard**: Pixel-space encoder attack\n",
    "- **MIST**: Pixel-space adversarial noise\n",
    "- **DiffusionGuard**: Pixel-space inpainting defense"
   ]
  },
