    "    [Robustness]        Compression: {dctroy_compressed_lpips_degradation:.2f}% | Purification: {dctroy_purified_lpips_degradation:.2f}%\n",
    "    \n",
    "    ╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n",
