    "    [Imperceptibility]  SSIM: {mist_ssim:.4f} | PSNR: {mist_psnr:.2f} | VIFP: {mist_vifp:.4f}\n",
    "    [Protection]        LPIPS: {mist_lpips:.4f}\n",
