    "    \n",
    "    [vs DiffusionGuard]\n",
    "    - SSIM Δ: {(dctroy_ssim - diffusionguard_ssim):+.4f} | PSNR Δ: {(dctroy_psnr - diffusionguard_psnr):+.2f}\n",
    "    - Protection LPIPS Δ: {(dctroy_lpips - diffusionguard_lpips):+.4f} (higher = better protection)\n",
